      "mergeID": "671bac52723bda7e1c21592c",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It is currently impossible to use pinch gestures to move or turn when using the built in hand tracking controls and using horizon adjust. This is an issue if you want to use hand tracking when lying down, as it makes it impossible to move around without switching back to controls. all of the other hand tracking gestures work properly (e.g. jumping). \n\nReproduction steps:\n\n1. enable horizon adjust and set your horizon when lying down\n\n2. enable hand tracking on a quest 2/3\n\n3. attempt to move using the pinch gestures",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Hand-Tracking movement does not respect horizon adjust",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "66b14158c4b09796aaaf7a19",
